# BuildKit uses THIS file (not the root allow-list, which admits only the Python
# core) for `-f deploy/e2e.playwright.Dockerfile` builds. The image COPYs web/
# only, so a deny-list keeps that tree and drops the heavy/irrelevant ones. A
# stale web/node_modules or web/dist must not shadow the frozen install.
.git
**/node_modules
**/target
web/dist
src
engine
mobile
docs
